      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "A variety of studies have been performed to investigate the ways to increase the rate of breast self-examination in patients with breast cancer.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 17,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Reminders including telephone, mail or visit improved the rate of breast self-examination in those studies.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 18,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Recently, short message service(SMS) was reported to improve the control of blood sugar level in DM patients and weight in obese patients but there is no randomized controlled study about the role of SMS in increasing the rate of breast self-examination.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 19,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The aim of this study is to examine whether SMS improve the rate of breast self-examination in patienst with breast cancer.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
